<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy - Sitecue</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/global.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-6">
    <a href="/" class="text-[#062032] hover:underline transition-colors">← Back to Home</a>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#062032] mt-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-zinc-500 mt-6">
      This Privacy Policy describes how Sitecue collects, uses, and shares your information when you use our Chrome Extension and Web App.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#062032] mt-12">Information Collection and Use</h2>
    <p class="text-zinc-500 mt-4">
      <strong>Chrome Extension:</strong> We collect data stored locally via chrome.storage and read/recognize URLs necessary for the extension's functionality.
    </p>
    <p class="text-zinc-500 mt-4">
      <strong>Web App:</strong> We synchronize notes, handle authentication, and integrate with Basecamp.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#062032] mt-12">Payment Processing</h2>
    <p class="text-zinc-500 mt-4">
      Sitecue integrates with Polar.sh (Polar Software, Inc.) as the Merchant of Record (MoR) responsible for processing transactions and billing. We do not store credit card information.
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#062032] mt-12">Contact and Support</h2>
    <p class="text-zinc-500 mt-4">
      For any questions regarding privacy or your rights as a user, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@sitecue.app" class="text-zinc-600 hover:underline">support@sitecue.app</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
